                            <p>Transfer times are approximate and depend on road and weather conditions.</p>
                            <p>
                              The duration of the hikes is also approximate and varies depending on the weather and
                              physical fitness of the participants.
                            </p>
                            <p>The maximum altitude of the route reaches 4390 meters.</p>
                            <p>
                              Lunch boxes are organized in a buffet style: after breakfast, each participant
                              independently selects food for lunch from a diverse assortment.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              It is recommended to have a personal water flask, as only boiled water is provided during
                              the trek.
