                              We set up <strong>stationary tent camps</strong> along the entire route. Every year we
                              improve the infrastructure and increase comfort for tour participants.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              If you book this route, you get access to all the amenities of our camps throughout the
                              tour.
                            </p>
                            <p><strong>What this gives you:</strong></p>
                            <ul>
                              <li>
                                <p>
                                  <strong>Ease and comfort on the way</strong><br />You do not carry food and bivouac
                                  equipment – everything is already organized
                                </p>
                              </li>
                              <li>
                                <p>
                                  <strong>Savings on escort</strong><br />No need to hire porters and a cook – less
                                  expenses, more freedom
                                </p>
                              </li>
                              <li>
                                <p>
                                  <strong>Safety</strong><br />There is communication in every camp, and you also get a
                                  detailed map of the route
                                </p>
                              </li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3>What is included in the equipment of each stationary tent camp</h3>
                            <ul>
                              <li>
                                <strong>RED FOX</strong> tents – capacity 4 people, but designed for accommodation of 2
                                people in each.
                              </li>
                              <li><strong>TEAM FOX</strong> dining tent – capacity 10–20 people.</li>
                              <li>Tents provide 5-centimeter mattresses and sleeping pads for a comfortable sleep.</li>
                              <li>
                                Electricity (from a generator) is available from 19:00 to 22:00 – for charging phones,
                                tablets, and other devices.
                              </li>
                              <li>
                                There is a toilet tent and a shower tent. For the shower, a small basin, a ladle, and
                                warm water are provided (please note that in bad weather, providing warm water can be
                                difficult).
